WEBVTT

00:12.053 --> 00:13.805
♪ See the daylight ♪

00:15.223 --> 00:17.392
♪ Covering the sky ♪

00:18.852 --> 00:22.230
♪ Hear the wind say ♪

00:22.313 --> 00:26.484
♪ No matter what you do, my friend ♪

00:26.568 --> 00:29.195
♪ You know the world
Still needs your light ♪

00:29.279 --> 00:32.449
♪ Let it just shine ♪

00:32.532 --> 00:34.951
♪ You'll be free ♪

00:35.035 --> 00:38.204
♪ From all the things you used to be ♪

00:43.752 --> 00:48.173
DOONA!

01:29.923 --> 01:31.925
[gentle music playing]

01:38.848 --> 01:39.891
[door opens]

01:40.600 --> 01:41.476
[door closes]

01:53.780 --> 01:54.739
[sighs]

02:17.762 --> 02:18.763
[sighs]

02:24.936 --> 02:27.313
[emotional music playing]

02:47.542 --> 02:50.170
EPISODE 5
MEANINGLESS KISS

03:01.723 --> 03:03.057
[curious music playing]

03:07.478 --> 03:08.563
[sighs]

03:24.621 --> 03:26.414
- [boy] Oh, hey.
- [girl] Hi.

03:26.497 --> 03:29.709
[boy] Hope you weren't waiting too long.
Sorry it took so long.

03:29.792 --> 03:31.753
[girl] Hey, I gotta run, guys. See you.

03:51.272 --> 03:52.190
Oh, you're here.

03:57.403 --> 03:59.530
Hey, um, could we talk for a second?

04:02.283 --> 04:03.117
Okay.

04:03.660 --> 04:04.494
Go ahead.

04:11.709 --> 04:12.710
What did you wanna say?

04:16.631 --> 04:17.465
[Doona scoffs]

04:19.467 --> 04:20.718
Did I touch you?

04:21.344 --> 04:22.178
Sorry.

04:24.264 --> 04:25.723
Why did you do that yesterday?

04:25.807 --> 04:26.766
Do what?

04:29.811 --> 04:30.687
Ah.

04:31.938 --> 04:33.231
Right, we kissed yesterday.

04:37.110 --> 04:37.944
I just did it.

04:39.070 --> 04:40.446
What other reason is there?

04:41.614 --> 04:43.783
Why? Wasn't the kiss good?

04:48.371 --> 04:49.497
Do you like me?

04:50.915 --> 04:52.125
Or do you not at all?

04:54.669 --> 04:55.670
[Won-jun sighs]

04:56.963 --> 04:58.631
Obviously you don't, then.

04:59.674 --> 05:01.884
Listen, Doona, I don't kiss friends.

05:03.094 --> 05:04.137
So if we could

05:05.346 --> 05:07.890
just keep things platonic from now on,
that'd be great.

05:08.933 --> 05:11.185
I know that you've been lonely here, and

05:11.978 --> 05:14.272
you've been longing for some comfort
to help cope with that.

05:14.355 --> 05:15.690
I totally understand.

05:16.232 --> 05:18.359
But that can lead to a misunderstanding.

05:18.985 --> 05:20.570
And you can get hurt in the end.

05:22.363 --> 05:23.197
Hey.

05:24.615 --> 05:26.409
You're really not much fun at all.

05:27.201 --> 05:30.121
You're only 21.
Why take everything so seriously?

05:33.291 --> 05:35.376
I didn't say I was looking for love.

05:35.460 --> 05:36.919
The kiss gave me butterflies.

05:40.965 --> 05:43.801
And I don't want to feel that way
over nothing, all right?

05:45.553 --> 05:47.305
It's okay to feel like that.

05:48.222 --> 05:49.974
Everyone does at first,
then gets over it.

05:50.558 --> 05:52.602
You won't be any different, all right?

06:02.653 --> 06:03.529
[door opens]

06:04.906 --> 06:05.740
[door closes]

06:06.282 --> 06:07.116
[sighs]

06:07.700 --> 06:09.160
[birds chirping]

06:20.463 --> 06:24.425
SEEKING FEMALE ROOMMATE
FOR FIRST FLOOR OF SHARED HOUSE

06:37.605 --> 06:39.982
Excuse me! Could you hold the elevator?

06:40.066 --> 06:41.067
[grunts] Excuse me!

06:42.276 --> 06:43.861
Wait, wait, wait! Hold on a sec! [grunts]

06:43.945 --> 06:45.071
[panting]

06:45.154 --> 06:46.572
Oh, thanks, guys!

06:47.156 --> 06:49.409
- Yikes, I'm sorry. Thank you.
- Ah, what is this?

06:49.492 --> 06:51.285
- Why didn't you just wait for the next?
- Oh.

06:52.537 --> 06:55.957
Oh! Oh! Oh! Oh!
The kissing king! The kissing king!

06:56.040 --> 06:58.418
- Samba girl?
- Yes, yes, yes, yes, hi!

06:58.501 --> 07:00.503
- It's me, the samba girl, yes!
- [chuckles] Ah!

07:00.586 --> 07:03.214
- Hey, this is so crazy!
- Are you headed to class or what?

07:03.297 --> 07:04.424
Oh, actually, no.

07:04.507 --> 07:07.552
Uh, I'll contact you later, and, uh…
and I'll let you know later, okay?

07:07.635 --> 07:09.095
- Okay.
- Oh, but anyways, I better run.

07:09.178 --> 07:10.888
- Oh, okay.
- Thanks so much.

07:15.476 --> 07:18.104
[sighs] Can I maybe stay
at your place for a few nights?

07:18.187 --> 07:19.397
- I gotta run.
- [sighs]

07:20.189 --> 07:21.816
Wait, baby, don't go. [cries]

07:21.899 --> 07:24.485
You piece of trash! Get away from me!

07:24.569 --> 07:26.612
[crying]

07:26.696 --> 07:29.115
What am I supposed to do now?

07:29.198 --> 07:30.158
[Won-jun] Hey.

07:32.660 --> 07:34.912
So, yesterday,
I was booted out of my dorm.

07:34.996 --> 07:36.956
Won't you help out a former girlfriend?

07:37.039 --> 07:39.041
[curious music playing]

07:39.959 --> 07:40.835
[I-ra grunts]

07:41.461 --> 07:42.545
[Jin-ju sighs]

07:44.505 --> 07:45.756
[Jin-ju exhales shakily]

07:45.840 --> 07:47.633
So, about what you
asked me the other day--

07:47.717 --> 07:50.261
When I… told you
that I have strong feelings for you?

07:51.637 --> 07:52.638
Yes.

07:53.222 --> 07:55.224
I'm ready to give my answer to you.

07:55.308 --> 07:59.520
You can take your time to think about it.
I have a feeling you won't.

08:00.646 --> 08:02.690
I have feelings for someone else, Se-hun.

08:05.234 --> 08:07.862
- I apologize if I gave you any mixed--
- It's Won-jun, right?

08:07.945 --> 08:08.779
Huh?

08:12.867 --> 08:14.911
For the record,
you never gave mixed signals.

08:14.994 --> 08:17.079
I always knew the truth.
I just ignored it.

08:17.788 --> 08:18.873
Um, well,

08:19.665 --> 08:20.958
I'm sorry, Se-hun.

08:23.044 --> 08:25.129
LITERARY SOCIETY
SPARK

08:29.300 --> 08:30.426
[sighs]

08:34.430 --> 08:35.306
[sighs]

08:38.184 --> 08:39.519
[phone chimes]

08:45.191 --> 08:46.817
MOVING OUT? YOU'RE PENNILESS.

08:46.901 --> 08:49.320
COME HOME,
OR I WON'T SUPPORT YOU EVER AGAIN

08:52.823 --> 08:55.535
I'M IN THE PARKING LOT
GET OVER HERE AS SOON AS YOU'RE DONE

08:55.618 --> 08:58.079
HAVE YOU FINALLY LOST IT?
HOW DARE YOU IGNORE MY CALLS?

08:58.162 --> 09:01.207
MOM SAYS YOU WORK PART-TIME. STUDY MORE.
DON'T HANG OUT LIKE A SLUT. REPLY!

09:02.333 --> 09:04.335
[somber music playing]

09:08.839 --> 09:15.846
GOODBYE

09:18.766 --> 09:21.519
DAD
BLOCK CONTACT

09:25.523 --> 09:27.066
[line ringing]

09:32.572 --> 09:33.781
Won-jun, hey.

09:49.380 --> 09:51.924
[Won-jun] What is this place? It's pretty.

09:52.008 --> 09:53.217
[Jin-ju] Oh, there you are.

09:53.718 --> 09:55.177
Come over here for a second, hmm?

09:56.679 --> 09:58.764
Look, you can see your place
from this angle.

09:59.640 --> 10:01.892
I never knew
the Humanities Department had a roof deck.

10:01.976 --> 10:04.478
[chuckles] There are many things
you don't know about.

10:12.111 --> 10:13.613
What are you thinking about?

10:13.696 --> 10:15.740
[inhales] It's just, um,

10:15.823 --> 10:19.535
there are so many buildings out there,
but not one belongs to me.

10:19.619 --> 10:21.412
- I guess we're alike.
- [chuckles]

10:21.495 --> 10:22.997
Uh… in that regard, no we're not.

10:26.208 --> 10:27.835
What makes you say that?

10:28.419 --> 10:29.879
I didn't mean anything, just…

10:30.755 --> 10:33.466
I just didn't think you had much
to worry about growing up, is all.

10:35.718 --> 10:37.011
Um, Jin-ju…

10:38.888 --> 10:39.847
[Jin-ju scoffs]

10:39.930 --> 10:42.350
I guess you don't know me
as well as you think you do.

10:52.276 --> 10:54.195
What's wrong, Jin-ju? What is it?

10:54.779 --> 10:57.490
Was there something I was mistaken about?
I don't get it.

11:02.411 --> 11:04.413
[somber music playing]

11:11.879 --> 11:12.880
[Jin-ju] I'm sorry.

11:15.966 --> 11:18.344
This isn't what I
wanted to talk about today.

11:19.261 --> 11:21.430
[exhales shakily] I'm so annoying, jeez.

11:26.644 --> 11:28.562
[somber music continues]

11:35.027 --> 11:36.278
- [door beeps]
- [lock clicks]

11:36.362 --> 11:37.196
[doorknob rattles]

12:07.351 --> 12:09.478
Won-Jun, don't drift too far away, okay?

12:12.481 --> 12:14.817
That's what I wanted to say to you
up on the roof.

12:15.651 --> 12:17.528
Don't let anything else happen.

12:18.904 --> 12:20.239
I'm at my wit's end.

12:24.618 --> 12:26.203
[grunts]

12:27.288 --> 12:28.289
[sighs]

12:33.085 --> 12:36.839
[I-ra] Hey, everyone! Choi I-ra is moving!

12:36.922 --> 12:38.340
[samba music playing]

12:38.424 --> 12:41.051
[both] ♪ Samba! Ah, ah, ah, ah ♪

12:41.135 --> 12:42.636
- ♪ Samba! ♪
- Whoo-hoo!

12:42.720 --> 12:43.554
[I-ra] That's right.

12:43.637 --> 12:45.014
♪ Ah, ah, ah, ah ♪

12:45.097 --> 12:47.016
[laughing]

12:47.600 --> 12:50.644
- [girl] Samba!
- [I-ra] Yeah, to the front! To the back!

12:51.395 --> 12:53.522
To the left. To the right.
To the front. To the back.

12:53.606 --> 12:54.857
Hey, look. Is that the cute guy!

12:54.940 --> 12:56.442
- Oh, hey, cute guy!
- I wanna see!

12:56.525 --> 12:59.153
- Hello.
- Hey, cute guy, looking hot!

12:59.236 --> 13:01.113
- We're in pj's!
- [girl] It's the cute guy.

13:01.197 --> 13:02.364
- Oh, hey!
- Hi!

13:02.448 --> 13:04.074
[Yun-taek laughs]

13:04.742 --> 13:06.035
[I-ra] How've you guys been?!

13:06.118 --> 13:07.411
[girls cheering]

13:07.495 --> 13:09.413
Uh, Yun-taek, what's happening?

13:09.497 --> 13:11.832
We had a vacancy here,
and she really needed a place to stay.

13:11.916 --> 13:13.834
Great, right? [chuckles]

13:13.918 --> 13:15.586
- Hey!
- Yay!

13:15.669 --> 13:17.713
Wow, how great is this? Welcome!

13:17.797 --> 13:19.924
[girl] Great choice! Hey, cute guy!

13:20.007 --> 13:21.467
[I-ra] Ah!

13:24.094 --> 13:25.554
- [girl] No way!
- From Dream Sweet!

13:25.638 --> 13:27.598
That's Lee Doona from Dream Sweet!

13:27.681 --> 13:30.309
Oh my gosh, it's Lee Doona!
It's Lee Doona! Oh wow!

13:30.392 --> 13:31.727
- Jeez! I can't even!
- [I-ra] Hello!

13:32.436 --> 13:34.063
- [girl laughs]
- So pretty.

13:34.897 --> 13:36.649
- [girl] So pretty!
- [girl 2] Totally gorgeous!

13:36.732 --> 13:38.692
- [girl] Gorgeous!
- Won-jun.

13:40.486 --> 13:41.529
[girl] Just look at her.

13:41.612 --> 13:43.823
- [I-ra chuckles]
- [vehicle approaches]

13:45.115 --> 13:47.076
Oh! She made it already.

13:55.459 --> 13:56.627
Thank you so much, sir.

14:01.799 --> 14:04.593
She left home, so I told her to come over.
I did good, right?

14:04.677 --> 14:06.178
[indistinct chatter]

14:12.101 --> 14:14.895
- [I-ra] Hey, Yun-taek
- Hey, could you please take this from me?

14:14.979 --> 14:16.814
- [girl] Put it there.
- [Yun-taek] Leave it here?

14:16.897 --> 14:18.107
[I-ra] Wait, put it here!

14:18.190 --> 14:20.609
Not over there! It looks better here!
I just told you that.

14:20.693 --> 14:21.861
Seriously, listen to me, okay?

14:21.944 --> 14:23.153
Hey! Seriously!

14:23.237 --> 14:26.574
- [Yun-taek] Let go. Let go.
- Yun-taek, just put that here for now!

14:27.283 --> 14:28.784
[I-ra] Won-jun, wait for me!

14:28.868 --> 14:31.078
- [chuckles]
- [Won-jun] What on Earth are you wearing?

14:31.161 --> 14:32.746
- Pajamas?
- Aren't they cute?

14:32.830 --> 14:35.374
I decided to give a pair
to each of my new roommates.

14:35.457 --> 14:36.458
I'm flexing here.

14:37.334 --> 14:38.335
Would you like one?

14:38.919 --> 14:40.379
[Won-jun] I'll pass, thanks.

14:40.462 --> 14:42.006
[I-ra] Oh, you know you want a pair.

14:42.882 --> 14:43.716
Hmm.

14:45.467 --> 14:46.844
- Hey.
- What?

14:47.636 --> 14:49.680
What's the deal with my new friend Doona?

14:50.306 --> 14:52.892
- Shouldn't you address her as your elder?
- No, why would I do that?

14:52.975 --> 14:54.184
I'm the same age as her.

14:54.268 --> 14:57.146
Would you give me some intel?
I have to live with her.

14:57.897 --> 14:59.773
Like, what kind of girl is she?
Is she crazy?

15:00.858 --> 15:02.401
I really have no idea,

15:03.193 --> 15:04.987
nor what's going on inside her head.

15:05.946 --> 15:07.865
- [I-ra chuckles]
- [door closes]

15:07.948 --> 15:09.658
We are here!

15:10.659 --> 15:11.744
Hey, you guys!

15:11.827 --> 15:13.370
We're back! Ah.

15:16.457 --> 15:19.668
- [Doona] Oh, you bought beer.
- It's time for us to get wasted tonight!

15:19.752 --> 15:21.128
- I'll take one.
- [I-ra] Here you go.

15:21.211 --> 15:23.130
[Jin-ju] This is heavy.
How did you carry it?

15:23.213 --> 15:24.715
[I-ra] I used the manservant upstairs.

15:25.424 --> 15:27.009
What? You wanna come in too?

15:27.092 --> 15:29.762
- Um, no, it's okay.
- [Doona] I wasn't gonna let you in anyway.

15:29.845 --> 15:31.805
You're an outcast now. You got that?

15:32.306 --> 15:33.599
[I-ra] You must know Kooksu too?

15:33.682 --> 15:35.476
- Of course I know Kooksu! Yes!
- Oh, you do?

15:35.559 --> 15:37.478
Oh, by the way,
he's inherited the business.

15:37.561 --> 15:38.854
- He's the CEO now!
- [I-ra] No way!

15:38.938 --> 15:41.065
- Ugh, that lucky son of a gun!
- [Jin-ju laughs]

15:41.148 --> 15:43.108
- You're annoyed!
- So not fair!

15:43.192 --> 15:45.736
- So his name is Kooksu?
- [Jin-ju and I-ra] His name is Su-jin!

15:45.819 --> 15:48.405
- Jinx! Jinx again! Jinx!
- [laughing]

15:49.198 --> 15:50.658
- [sighs]
- [I-ra] Kook Su-jin, right?

15:50.741 --> 15:53.118
- Yup. Kooksu is really funny, isn't he?
- He really is.

15:53.202 --> 15:54.036
[Jin-ju laughs]

15:54.119 --> 15:56.455
[I-ra] So then,
you must know Happy Pharmacy.

15:56.538 --> 15:57.957
Of course! They're still open.

15:58.040 --> 15:59.959
- No way, seriously?
- For sure!

16:00.042 --> 16:01.585
- Hmm, I loved it there.
- [Jin-ju] Really?

16:01.669 --> 16:04.046
Back then, Kooksu and I
would go there together

16:04.129 --> 16:06.548
because he had a huge crush
on the owner's beautiful daughter,

16:06.632 --> 16:09.009
and he bought so many energy drinks,
he got addicted!

16:09.093 --> 16:12.513
And Won-jun, as his trusty sidekick,
ended up getting addicted with him!

16:12.596 --> 16:14.181
- [Jin-ju laughs]
- [I-ra] What idiots!

16:14.264 --> 16:16.433
They were always
walking around like zombies!

16:16.517 --> 16:17.518
[imitates zombie moaning]

16:25.150 --> 16:26.402
[door beeps, opens]

16:28.237 --> 16:29.113
[door closes]

16:29.196 --> 16:30.030
[door beeps]

16:31.448 --> 16:32.700
[Doona] What brings you out?

16:33.367 --> 16:35.369
I-ra's on the phone with her mother now.

16:38.706 --> 16:39.707
[Jin-ju sighs]

16:45.587 --> 16:47.840
It must be weird for you
to have roommates living with you.

16:47.923 --> 16:48.882
Mm-mm.

16:50.175 --> 16:52.052
I've lived in dorms before, you know.

16:53.137 --> 16:54.138
It must be hard for you.

16:54.221 --> 16:58.100
Mmm. Well, um, no.
It feels like I'm on a school trip.

16:58.183 --> 17:00.477
[chuckles] Is that what it feels like?

17:01.520 --> 17:03.939
I never got to experience
a school trip at all.

17:05.649 --> 17:08.527
Well, then the three of us
should plan a trip together one day soon.

17:08.610 --> 17:10.612
We could even wear school uniforms.

17:11.530 --> 17:12.990
- Sounds good.
- [Jin-ju chuckles]

17:24.251 --> 17:26.045
I have a question for you.

17:26.754 --> 17:28.839
Why did you want
roommates so suddenly, huh?

17:30.049 --> 17:30.883
And you?

17:32.384 --> 17:34.303
Why did you move out
of your home so suddenly?

17:34.928 --> 17:36.513
I think it was just the timing.

17:38.098 --> 17:40.142
All the things that could go wrong did.

17:41.852 --> 17:44.104
That mixed with everything else going on

17:44.772 --> 17:48.609
all led to a final breaking point for me
that I just knew it was time for a change

17:48.692 --> 17:51.445
and I had to leave.
That's how it all transpired.

17:53.447 --> 17:55.157
I'm trying to stick up for myself.

18:00.496 --> 18:02.539
I confessed to Won-jun
how I felt about him.

18:05.250 --> 18:06.919
- Is that so?
- [Jin-ju] Yes.

18:07.920 --> 18:10.130
Not directly,
but it was enough for him to, uh,

18:10.923 --> 18:13.008
get the picture of how I really feel.

18:18.639 --> 18:21.058
That's why I'm here.
To wait out his answer.

18:22.643 --> 18:25.479
- This time I don't want to lose him.
- What are we to do?

18:29.066 --> 18:31.360
Well, despite the fact
I let you rent a room here,

18:32.820 --> 18:35.239
I can't root for you and Won-jun
in that regard,

18:35.781 --> 18:38.033
because now, I've also gotten involved.

18:38.951 --> 18:40.494
[chuckles]

18:43.122 --> 18:44.540
[emotional music playing]

18:50.170 --> 18:51.004
Doona,

18:55.008 --> 18:56.552
I know Won-jun very well.

18:57.052 --> 18:59.638
He always overthinks things
before doing them.

19:01.557 --> 19:04.518
He's always really cautious
about making big decisions, and, um,

19:04.601 --> 19:07.855
he doesn't get involved
with anything unstable or precarious.

19:07.938 --> 19:10.983
It makes him uncomfortable
because he doesn't want to get hurt.

19:11.817 --> 19:15.112
We've known each other for a long time.
We were very close.

19:16.488 --> 19:17.948
We had feelings for each other.

19:18.532 --> 19:20.033
[chuckles]

19:21.160 --> 19:23.036
It was really special for us.

19:28.083 --> 19:30.961
[Jeong-hun] Ugh, we're late! Let's run!
I have a lecture first period!

19:31.044 --> 19:32.754
[Yun-taek] We're gonna be late anyway.

19:32.838 --> 19:35.507
[I-ra] No! No, come back!
Here. Hold your girlfriend.

19:35.591 --> 19:38.051
Listen, all of my stuff is so heavy.
Can't we just take a taxi?

19:38.135 --> 19:39.011
No way. Let go!

19:39.094 --> 19:40.345
How much stuff are you carrying?

19:40.429 --> 19:43.473
Whatever. You should carry it!
Here! Let's go.

19:43.557 --> 19:46.310
- [Won-jun] Nope!
- [I-ra] What's your problem, you jerk?

19:46.393 --> 19:48.270
Don't throw my stuff!
What's wrong with you?

19:49.021 --> 19:50.939
[Jin-ju] It was really special for us.

19:51.607 --> 19:53.692
We spent our teenage years together.

19:54.818 --> 19:56.612
We were so close,
we could take on the world.

19:57.362 --> 19:59.907
So we have a connection unlike any other,
you know?

20:00.949 --> 20:02.993
That's a really powerful thing to have.

20:05.412 --> 20:07.414
So that's what I'm putting my faith into.

20:08.373 --> 20:09.416
[Yun-taek and I-ra laugh]

20:09.499 --> 20:11.960
- [Yun-taek] Look, we should eat first.
- [I-ra] Ow! That hurts!

20:12.044 --> 20:13.670
- Ow, ow!
- [Won-jun] Ah! Hold on!

20:13.754 --> 20:15.881
- [I-ra] What are you doing?
- [Won-jun] Sorry. Ow!

20:15.964 --> 20:17.090
- Ugh, seriously!
- [I-ra yells]

20:17.174 --> 20:18.759
[overlapping chatter]

20:18.842 --> 20:20.469
- [I-ra] Hey!
- [Yun-taek] Come on, guys.

20:20.552 --> 20:22.638
- [Jin-ju] Wait up!
- [Jeong-hun] Go! Go! Go!

20:23.472 --> 20:24.681
[Yun-taek] Hey, Won-jun!

20:30.103 --> 20:32.606
Hey, so how's it going
living with a celebrity?

20:32.689 --> 20:33.690
Are you guys friends yet?

20:33.774 --> 20:36.860
And what's her personality like?
Because her reputation sucks.

20:36.944 --> 20:39.279
Pretty sure she's like anyone else.

20:39.363 --> 20:41.740
So what about all the men, huh?

20:43.742 --> 20:45.244
[chuckles]

20:45.327 --> 20:46.411
Oh, that.

20:48.914 --> 20:51.416
- What's the face for?
- What's with your nostrils? What is it?

20:51.500 --> 20:52.626
You're scaring me.

20:54.002 --> 20:55.128
[I-ra grunts]

21:00.509 --> 21:02.302
Actually, to be honest…

21:02.886 --> 21:04.263
So earlier this morning, uh…

21:04.346 --> 21:05.264
[girl] Uh-huh.

21:14.314 --> 21:15.816
MEN
CLOSE THE CURTAIN BEFORE SHOWERING

21:15.899 --> 21:17.276
[shower running]

21:17.359 --> 21:18.277
Oh.

21:18.360 --> 21:20.028
[suspenseful music playing]

21:20.946 --> 21:22.197
[mysterious music playing]

21:25.117 --> 21:26.201
[I-ra sighs]

21:36.211 --> 21:37.838
[both scream]

21:41.800 --> 21:42.926
I-ra Choi!

21:43.010 --> 21:45.595
[cheering]

21:45.679 --> 21:47.264
- [girls] Marry him!
- Ha!

21:47.347 --> 21:48.640
- [girls] Marry him!
- Ha!

21:48.724 --> 21:50.225
- [girls] Marry him!
- [I-ra] Ah!

21:57.858 --> 21:59.735
[Won-jun] The kiss gave me butterflies.

21:59.818 --> 22:01.194
[emotional music playing]

22:02.487 --> 22:05.324
And I don't want to feel
that way over nothing, all right?

22:38.565 --> 22:40.150
[dance music playing]

23:15.435 --> 23:18.688
[man] Be careful when you're alone
in a crowd. It's obvious.

23:21.691 --> 23:23.610
[Doona] What do you mean? What's obvious?

23:24.945 --> 23:26.238
[man] Your loneliness.

23:27.280 --> 23:30.909
Your desperation to be loved,
to try to compensate for never having it.

23:31.868 --> 23:33.995
You're afraid of losing people's interest.

23:35.414 --> 23:37.165
[dance music continues]

23:43.588 --> 23:47.092
- Samba girl, I-ra Choi!
- The kissing king, Yun-taek! [laughs]

23:47.175 --> 23:48.176
[Yun-taek] Mmm.

23:48.677 --> 23:50.720
[slapping hands together]

23:50.804 --> 23:52.931
- [I-ra laughs]
- [Yun-taek] Why are you so giddy?

23:53.014 --> 23:55.600
- [I-ra and Yun-taek laugh]
- [I-ra] Who's the girl you like?

23:55.684 --> 23:57.769
- Thank you for feeding us.
- Mm-hmm.

23:58.270 --> 24:01.314
- I can help clean if you want.
- Oh, no, that's okay. I got it. Thanks.

24:01.815 --> 24:04.151
[Yun-taek and I-ra chatting indistinctly]

24:04.234 --> 24:05.777
Hey, could I borrow a blanket from you?

24:05.861 --> 24:08.613
Uh, there's… there's
a blanket in my room you can borrow.

24:08.697 --> 24:09.573
Ah.

24:10.574 --> 24:11.533
Thank you so much.

24:11.616 --> 24:12.576
Hmm.

24:28.592 --> 24:30.302
THE ART OF MATHEMATICS

24:44.524 --> 24:45.400
[gasps]

24:48.403 --> 24:49.237
[sighs]

25:23.438 --> 25:25.440
[somber music playing]

25:31.947 --> 25:34.282
- [Won-jun] Did you find it?
- Uh-huh.

25:37.244 --> 25:39.412
- [Won-jun] Come have a drink with us then.
- Mm-hmm.

25:52.801 --> 25:53.718
[sighs]

25:53.802 --> 25:55.804
[dance music playing]

25:56.846 --> 25:57.889
[girl gasps]

25:57.973 --> 26:01.309
- [girl 2] Wasn't that someone famous?
- [girl] Did I gasp way too loud?

26:03.603 --> 26:06.064
[girl 2] She's from Dream Sweet.
Dream Sweet.

26:06.982 --> 26:08.984
I didn't know she goes clubbing.

26:21.663 --> 26:23.873
- Don't you know who I am?
- Huh?!

26:25.375 --> 26:26.626
You're Lee Doona!

26:27.961 --> 26:29.462
[indistinct chatter]

26:36.303 --> 26:37.804
[chuckles] I'm honored.

26:37.887 --> 26:41.891
A huge idol star like yourself approaching
a washed-up former teen idol like me.

26:42.809 --> 26:45.687
Yeah, it's kind of like
when you meet another Korean

26:45.770 --> 26:47.897
that's traveling the globe
and you run into them.

26:49.065 --> 26:52.193
And now you're even prettier, huh?
What are you up to these days?

26:52.277 --> 26:53.153
Nothing much, really.

26:54.029 --> 26:55.113
[sighs]

26:55.196 --> 26:58.158
It's too bad what went down.
And at the height of your career.

26:59.409 --> 27:02.370
- Yeah, I screwed it all up. So what?
- [man] Yeah.

27:02.871 --> 27:04.998
You know, I bet
if I was given a chance again,

27:05.081 --> 27:06.625
I could handle this industry shit.

27:06.708 --> 27:10.003
[scoffs] Although, I'm told
there's always some new shit to handle.

27:10.837 --> 27:12.339
- I feel for you.
- [chuckles]

27:12.422 --> 27:14.215
- [man chuckles]
- Hmm.

27:16.509 --> 27:19.137
- You wanna head out?
- Sure, why not?

27:20.096 --> 27:21.640
[Yun-taek] People are, you know…

27:22.474 --> 27:25.935
Well, they're designed to…
to instinctively recognize others

27:26.019 --> 27:27.687
that are similar to themselves.

27:27.771 --> 27:30.273
- Take I-ra Choi here.
- [I-ra] Uh-huh!

27:30.357 --> 27:34.152
[Yun-taek] The moment I saw her,
I knew right away that she was totally

27:34.235 --> 27:36.112
my kind of person, hey?

27:36.196 --> 27:38.990
- That's why we mesh so well, right?
- You're so nice, Yun-taek! Ah!

27:39.074 --> 27:42.535
Jin-ju and Won-jun,
is it exactly the same for you guys?

27:42.619 --> 27:44.913
Like, birds of a feather? Huh?

27:44.996 --> 27:45.830
Right, guys?

27:46.956 --> 27:47.832
[Won-jun sighs]

27:51.628 --> 27:53.338
- [I-ra] Uh, so…
- [Yun-taek] Hmm.

27:53.421 --> 27:55.298
- Yay!
- Yay, yay! Here.

27:55.382 --> 27:56.549
- Uh… to the king!
- To the king!

27:56.633 --> 27:58.301
Yeah! [chuckles] Uh…

27:58.385 --> 28:00.178
- Ugh! Seriously?!
- [Yun-taek] Stop complaining.

28:00.261 --> 28:02.097
- [I-ra] I'm sorry.
- [Yun-taek] Come on.

28:02.180 --> 28:04.641
I can carry her, okay? I'll carry her.

28:04.724 --> 28:06.768
- [Jeong-hun] Open the door, will you?
- Open what door?

28:06.851 --> 28:08.061
Oh, this door.

28:08.144 --> 28:11.147
- [Jeong-hun] Jeez, this girl is so weird.
- [Yun-taek] Hey, be quiet, will you?

28:11.231 --> 28:12.565
[Jeong-hun] Stop it!

28:12.649 --> 28:14.067
Wanna take a walk?

28:14.150 --> 28:15.860
[Jeong-hun] Keep going.

28:15.944 --> 28:17.570
- Um…
- Let's go now.

28:17.654 --> 28:19.948
[Yun-taek] I could carry her
with one hand. Trust me.

28:39.259 --> 28:40.260
Oh!

28:40.343 --> 28:41.177
Look.

28:42.220 --> 28:43.221
I wanna try it.

28:44.347 --> 28:45.348
[Jin-ju chuckles]

28:47.100 --> 28:47.934
Uh…

29:02.782 --> 29:03.867
[gasps]

29:09.289 --> 29:10.123
Leave it alone.

29:10.206 --> 29:11.624
[sighs]

29:13.585 --> 29:14.544
It's broken, Jin-ju.

29:15.503 --> 29:16.421
[sighs]

29:21.718 --> 29:23.136
OUT OF ORDER!
DO NOT INSERT COINS!

29:23.219 --> 29:25.096
[Jin-ju] I thought I'd sooner die than

29:25.180 --> 29:28.391
actually tell you about
what was going on with my family.

29:30.560 --> 29:31.561
Just so you know,

29:33.396 --> 29:35.398
I was really happy that day. [sighs]

29:36.649 --> 29:39.360
The guy I really liked
finally told me that he was into me.

29:39.444 --> 29:40.361
I was on cloud nine.

29:52.832 --> 29:53.958
I really like you.

29:56.419 --> 29:58.755
[Jin-ju] My heart felt
like it was about to burst.

29:58.838 --> 30:00.965
I felt like I got everything I wanted.

30:01.466 --> 30:03.885
I was so happy,
I wanted to scream and shout.

30:05.929 --> 30:07.931
[emotional music playing]

30:13.645 --> 30:16.314
There were so many things
I wanted to do together.

30:18.983 --> 30:21.152
I felt we could do anything,
and I couldn't wait.

30:22.612 --> 30:23.571
[Jin-ju's dad] Hey!

30:24.072 --> 30:27.367
Write down everything
you did with the guy! Do it now.

30:28.993 --> 30:31.830
I said now! I'll show you!
You defiant bitch!

30:31.913 --> 30:34.666
[Jin-ju's mom] Honey, no! Just stop!
Stop! Stop it!

30:38.294 --> 30:40.505
- [emotional music playing]
- [breathing shakily]

30:41.923 --> 30:43.967
[Jin-ju] It was like
falling out of a dream.

30:44.509 --> 30:46.386
I was suddenly back in reality.

30:46.469 --> 30:47.762
[crying]

30:49.055 --> 30:50.974
The Jin-ju that you really liked,

30:51.057 --> 30:52.475
well, that girl was

30:52.559 --> 30:55.854
always cheerful, appeared super confident,
and always had a smile.

30:56.855 --> 30:59.941
But I was actually hiding myself from you.
That wasn't real,

31:00.024 --> 31:03.027
because deep down,
I was miserable and had a troubled family.

31:07.740 --> 31:10.159
I didn't want you to know
what was going on, you know?

31:12.078 --> 31:13.037
[sighs]

31:17.625 --> 31:19.711
Don't you have anything
you wanna tell me, Won-jun?

31:23.715 --> 31:25.133
[sighs]

31:29.721 --> 31:30.680
I, uh…

31:33.016 --> 31:34.767
I really liked you a lot, Jin-ju.

31:54.287 --> 31:56.414
[emotional music playing]

31:56.497 --> 31:57.498
[Won-jun] I, uh…

31:58.875 --> 32:00.293
I really liked you a lot, Jin-ju.

32:02.795 --> 32:05.089
So much so that I didn't want to see you

32:05.632 --> 32:07.383
in case I fell for you again.

32:08.384 --> 32:10.261
I was worried I would get hurt, you know?

32:11.846 --> 32:14.223
I kept my distance
so that when I saw you again,

32:14.974 --> 32:17.310
I would feel unsure whether or not, um,

32:18.269 --> 32:19.896
I ever had those feelings at all.

32:21.814 --> 32:24.150
I wish I could've been there
to comfort you

32:24.233 --> 32:26.903
when you were dealing with
the family issues, Jin-ju.

32:28.279 --> 32:29.197
But now,

32:31.366 --> 32:33.159
too much time has passed, I think.

32:34.619 --> 32:36.454
[Jin-ju] You could comfort me now.

32:37.705 --> 32:39.540
I still need it, you know? Hmm?

32:40.041 --> 32:43.670
Please give this a chance.
I still want your support, Won-jun.

32:43.753 --> 32:45.088
[sighs] Huh?

32:45.171 --> 32:47.382
You can get there again.
It's still in you, hmm?

32:47.465 --> 32:49.092
[emotional music continues]

32:53.805 --> 32:55.556
We're talking about us here.

33:01.938 --> 33:02.855
I'm really sorry.

33:05.274 --> 33:07.402
The reason I wanted
to take a walk with you

33:08.152 --> 33:09.821
was to say it's different now.

33:13.074 --> 33:15.076
[emotional music continues]

34:00.079 --> 34:01.122
[cat meows]

34:10.256 --> 34:11.174
[Won-jun sighs]

34:16.512 --> 34:17.555
[cat meows]

34:19.390 --> 34:20.391
[sighs]

34:31.360 --> 34:32.236
Good night.

34:37.742 --> 34:40.328
What the fuck?
What do you think you're doing?

34:41.954 --> 34:42.789
[scoffs]

34:44.415 --> 34:45.708
Ah.

34:46.459 --> 34:48.711
So that's how you mess with guys.

34:48.795 --> 34:50.546
I know a lot of people can't stand you.

34:51.130 --> 34:52.507
And now I totally get it.

34:53.633 --> 34:55.343
Yeah? How about you get lost, huh?

34:56.761 --> 34:58.930
You do this all for his attention,
don't you?

35:03.935 --> 35:05.269
Where's your manager now?

35:07.897 --> 35:08.981
Sucks for you, doesn't it?

35:09.857 --> 35:11.943
I heard he cut you off completely.
Isn't that right?

35:12.777 --> 35:15.071
- [laughs]
- [gate squeaks]

35:15.822 --> 35:17.031
[Won-jun] Everything okay?

35:18.241 --> 35:20.118
[scoffs] Who are you supposed to be, huh?

35:22.036 --> 35:22.870
[scoffs]

35:23.538 --> 35:25.665
Is this who you're hanging out with?
Seriously?

35:26.374 --> 35:27.375
You…

35:29.502 --> 35:31.337
- Tell me, how old are you?
- What about you, huh?

35:31.420 --> 35:32.839
What did you say, shithead?

35:33.965 --> 35:37.051
Hey. I left my phone in your car.

35:38.761 --> 35:40.263
I'll get it for you.

35:42.056 --> 35:43.182
Let's go get it.

35:45.977 --> 35:47.395
[groans]

35:49.230 --> 35:50.606
[man] Unbelievable.

36:02.535 --> 36:06.038
- Ah… boy…
- Are you her friend?

36:06.122 --> 36:06.998
What?

36:07.081 --> 36:09.500
I said, "Are you her friend or what?"

36:10.168 --> 36:11.085
[scoffs]

36:12.753 --> 36:15.006
Man, that girl doesn't have any friends.

36:15.506 --> 36:16.465
[Won-jun sighs]

36:17.300 --> 36:20.386
I'm in the same position you are, kid.
She's a lot.

36:21.012 --> 36:24.223
[chuckles] You know,
it's really not even funny, but…

36:24.307 --> 36:27.018
[scoffs] …she'll pounce on anyone
just to get that prick's attention.

36:27.101 --> 36:28.686
I'm talking about her manager, huh?

36:29.187 --> 36:30.980
If she's that desperate, then I'll do it.

36:31.063 --> 36:33.482
I'll give her what she wants.
Everyone wins, right?

36:35.401 --> 36:36.360
[sighs]

36:36.986 --> 36:38.905
What? Wanna punch me? Go ahead.

36:41.407 --> 36:42.742
I think you need to leave.

36:44.243 --> 36:46.996
Why? You think you're different?

36:47.955 --> 36:50.249
What, are you fucking
in love with her or something?

36:50.333 --> 36:51.876
Yikes.

36:51.959 --> 36:54.003
[laughs]

36:54.795 --> 36:57.673
Ah! Fuck! [groans]

36:57.757 --> 36:59.133
[cries]

37:00.885 --> 37:03.179
You asshole… [groans]

37:03.930 --> 37:06.349
Ah. [cries]

37:10.478 --> 37:12.480
[footsteps approaching]

37:37.171 --> 37:39.507
I wanna know what goes on
in that mind of yours.

37:44.345 --> 37:45.888
You're really something, you know that?

37:57.358 --> 37:58.234
[sighs]

38:22.008 --> 38:23.009
[exhales]

38:23.968 --> 38:25.636
[dramatic music playing]

38:33.185 --> 38:34.020
[exhales]

38:52.371 --> 38:54.081
It's okay to feel like that.

38:54.165 --> 38:57.543
Everyone does at first, then gets over it.
You won't be any different, all right?

38:58.419 --> 39:00.504
[panting]

39:00.588 --> 39:02.131
[music fades]

39:12.141 --> 39:14.143
- [Doona] Why are you out here?
- [exhales]

39:31.827 --> 39:32.953
You're so sweaty.

39:33.037 --> 39:34.330
Fix your hair. Here.

39:38.834 --> 39:39.710
[sighs]

39:41.295 --> 39:42.129
What?

39:43.047 --> 39:44.090
Is it off-limits?

39:47.343 --> 39:48.719
You getting fuzzy feelings?

39:55.851 --> 39:56.811
I suck at dribbling.

40:19.750 --> 40:20.751
[sighs]

40:20.835 --> 40:21.669
Hey!

40:46.318 --> 40:48.070
I wanna ask you
something about what you said.

40:51.240 --> 40:53.159
Just who am I no different from, huh?

40:53.868 --> 40:55.911
That guy from tonight? If not, then who?

40:59.039 --> 41:00.541
I guess you forgot what you said.

41:01.333 --> 41:04.420
You told me you didn't want
to feel this way… over nothing.

41:04.503 --> 41:05.921
Sure, I didn't refute it,

41:06.505 --> 41:08.257
because I was worried you were right.

41:11.469 --> 41:14.388
That's why I tried to meet someone else
at the club tonight, okay?

41:15.181 --> 41:16.765
I wanted to test my feelings.

41:18.434 --> 41:19.727
Whether they were real or not.

41:20.811 --> 41:22.938
I wanted to know
how much I really liked you…

41:25.065 --> 41:27.693
and that I wasn't just trying
to get a man to obsess over me.

41:30.571 --> 41:32.531
If I have fallen for you, then what next?

41:34.575 --> 41:37.203
If I told you that even when I'm
surrounded by other people,

41:37.286 --> 41:38.871
that I only want you, Won-jun,

41:38.954 --> 41:40.623
that I find myself missing you
every minute…

41:43.959 --> 41:46.128
If I say
I've completely fallen in love with you…

41:48.130 --> 41:49.632
then what will you do?

41:58.015 --> 41:59.600
Hmm. See what I mean?

42:00.851 --> 42:02.520
You're right. This is meaningless.

42:37.221 --> 42:38.889
I thought you didn't kiss your friends.

42:40.641 --> 42:41.517
I don't.

42:44.353 --> 42:46.814
[emotional music playing]

42:52.695 --> 42:56.448
♪ I close my eyes and I see you ♪

43:00.160 --> 43:03.747
♪ I feel my heart beating for you ♪

43:06.875 --> 43:09.920
♪ You take my breath away ♪

43:10.421 --> 43:13.674
♪ Whenever you hold me close ♪

43:13.757 --> 43:15.718
♪ I realized ♪

43:18.137 --> 43:21.473
♪ I can't go back ♪

43:24.768 --> 43:27.354
♪ I will take time ♪

43:27.438 --> 43:29.356
♪ Or steps ♪

43:29.440 --> 43:32.901
♪ Till we're two and you move back ♪

43:32.985 --> 43:36.780
♪ There's no reason this needs to hide ♪

43:36.864 --> 43:39.658
♪ For me ♪

43:40.367 --> 43:44.413
♪ Even though it's too far ♪

43:44.496 --> 43:46.832
♪ It doesn't matter where you are ♪

43:46.915 --> 43:50.461
♪ My thoughts always go back to you ♪

43:50.544 --> 43:53.964
♪ Because it's you ♪

43:59.303 --> 44:01.847
♪ I hold your hand so tight ♪

44:01.930 --> 44:03.932
♪ I see you ♪

44:06.894 --> 44:10.939
♪ I promise I'll never leave it ♪

44:12.983 --> 44:16.612
♪ You find relief in my answer ♪

44:17.112 --> 44:20.783
♪ I won't ask you to take no more ♪

44:20.866 --> 44:24.620
♪ I'm drawn to you ♪

44:24.703 --> 44:27.706
♪ My moon ♪

44:31.377 --> 44:34.088
♪ I will take time ♪

44:34.171 --> 44:36.048
♪ Or steps ♪

44:36.131 --> 44:39.843
♪ Till we're two and you move back ♪

44:39.927 --> 44:43.222
♪ There's no reason this needs to hide ♪

44:43.305 --> 44:46.308
♪ For me ♪

44:46.934 --> 44:50.896
♪ Even though it's too far ♪

44:50.979 --> 44:53.399
♪ It doesn't matter where you are ♪

44:53.482 --> 44:56.944
♪ My thoughts always go back to you ♪

44:57.027 --> 45:00.948
♪ Because it's you ♪

45:13.335 --> 45:15.879
♪ I'm telling you ♪

45:15.963 --> 45:17.548
♪ I love ♪

45:18.048 --> 45:21.719
♪ Every moment spent with you ♪

45:21.802 --> 45:25.013
♪ There's no reason this needs to hide ♪

45:25.097 --> 45:27.850
♪ For me ♪

45:28.851 --> 45:32.896
♪ Even though it's too far ♪

45:32.980 --> 45:35.315
♪ It doesn't matter where you are ♪

45:35.399 --> 45:39.027
♪ My thoughts always go back to you ♪

45:39.111 --> 45:41.864
♪ Because ♪

45:43.031 --> 45:45.075
♪ It's you ♪
